Q- Find the field widths. Work out the minimum number of bits needed for the register field, the 
operation selection, the LDI immediate, the memory offset, the branch displacement and the 
JMP target. Show your calculation. (3 marks) 

No of bits to represent 
    Register fields = 4 (0-15)
    Operation Selection = 4 (16 operations)
    immediate (signed constant) = 4 (-8 to +7)
    memory offset = 4 (-8 to +7)
    branch displacement = 5 (-16 to +15)
    JMP target = 8 (unsigned 0 to 255) 
